nodes.title:
scripts/live-checks.mjs runs the post-deploy checks against a base URL without the owner, on one fresh @taxila.test guardian (children Riya and Kabir) deleted in a finally, and prints a pass / fail / manual table:
- pairing: redeem in an empty browser; no guardian email or sibling in any device response or on screen; parent routes refused; unpair → 401 → /pair?unpaired=1;
- placement: both POSTs, the note, and the corner's 'Where Riya begins';
- email code: with TAXILA_OPS_KEY; the real inbox stays MANUAL;
- card timing: the Desk's page clock (QA log, localStorage tx.qa=1) and the card switch against the board player's erase, ±300 ms; best effort, MANUAL when no paged turn comes.
Exercised end to end against a mock with Platform's semantics. Reverse: Platform builds a server-side test harness that supersedes it.
